---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy | PickleTagum" description="How PickleTagum handles website information and analytics.">
  <main class="legal shell">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark"><span></span>Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy at PickleTagum</h1>
    <p>PickleTagum is a navigation directory for pickleball courts in Tagum City. Reservations, payments, and court transactions happen directly with each venue or its booking platform.</p>

    <h2>Website analytics</h2>
    <p>PickleTagum uses Vercel Web Analytics to understand general website usage, such as page visits, referrers, device type, and approximate location. This helps improve the directory. PickleTagum does not sell personal information.</p>

    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>Court booking pages, Facebook pages, and other external links have their own privacy practices. Review their policies before sharing information, creating an account, or making a payment.</p>

    <h2>Directory corrections</h2>
    <p>If you want to report outdated court information or have a privacy question, contact the developer through the <a href="https://www.facebook.com/real.z4ynu/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">PickleTagum Facebook contact page</a>.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
